Hardware facts taken from other sources
---------------------------------------

The firmware contains hardware facts for the Waveshare
ESP32-C6-Touch-AMOLED-2.16, taken from Waveshare's demo repository
https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-C6-Touch-AMOLED-2.16 at commit
294543798f1a44e2f2c4d2976522323f2beee11d:

- firmware/main/board.h: the GPIO pin map (display QSPI, I2C, touch reset and
  interrupt) and the power chip's I2C address. From
  02_Example/ESP-IDF-v5.5.3/09_LVGL_V9_Test, 02_Example/Arduino-v3.3.3/
  09_LVGL_V9_Test/user_config.h and 02_Example/XiaoZhi-v2.2.5/main/boards/
  waveshare/esp32-c6-touch-amoled-2.16/config.h.
- firmware/main/display.c: the CO5300 panel init values (s_init_cmds). The
  same 2.16-inch panel sequence is published under permissive licenses:
  - Espressif esp-brookesia, CC0-1.0, commit 2bb43d86:
    https://github.com/espressif/esp-brookesia/blob/2bb43d86b0f5f7fd70b6323eddfd7c0476095c93/hal/brookesia_hal_boards/boards/waveshare/esp32_s3_touch_amoled_2_16/setup_device.c#L19-L37
  - Waveshare-ESP32-components, Apache-2.0, commit 23a6012d:
    https://github.com/waveshareteam/Waveshare-ESP32-components/blob/23a6012d5e87d27399cf90fb851cab3689e29159/bsp/esp32_s3_touch_amoled_2_16/esp32_s3_touch_amoled_2_16.c#L53-L71
  Those target the ESP32-S3 version of the board (MADCTL 0x36 = 0xA0). The
  C6-specific value, MADCTL 0x36 = 0x30, and the brightness command encoding,
  the even/odd area rounding and the touch orientation flags come from the
  Waveshare C6 demo above (02_Example/ESP-IDF-v5.5.3/09_LVGL_V9_Test,
  components/port_bsp/display_bsp.cpp and components/app_bsp/lvgl_bsp.cpp).
  That repository carries no license file.
- firmware/main/axp2101.c: the AXP2101 register values (DCDC1 and ALDO1-4 at
  3.3 V, the ALDO3 power cycle that resets the panel). From XiaoZhi, MIT
  licensed, "Copyright (c) 2025 Shenzhen Xinzhi Future Technology Co., Ltd."
  and "Copyright (c) 2025 Project Contributors", commit a3134949:
  https://github.com/78/xiaozhi-esp32/blob/a31349491ba9805c5e7b7f7b4dc6f33172cdc655/main/boards/waveshare/esp32-c6-touch-amoled-2.16/esp32-c6-touch-amoled-2.16.cc#L29-L59
  The same values are in the Waveshare C6 demo's power_bsp.cpp. The register
  addresses match XPowersLib (REG/AXP2101Constants.h), MIT licensed,
  Copyright (c) 2022 lewis he.

These are register values and pin numbers, not program logic. All code in
this repository was written for it.

Dependencies (fetched at build time, not included here)
-------------------------------------------------------

- ESP-IDF v5.5.6, including cJSON: Apache-2.0 (cJSON: MIT).
- espressif/esp_lvgl_port, espressif/esp_lcd_sh8601, espressif/esp_lcd_touch,
  espressif/cmake_utilities: Apache-2.0.
- waveshare/esp_lcd_touch_cst9217: Apache-2.0.
- lvgl/lvgl 9.6: MIT. The firmware uses LVGL's built-in Montserrat fonts,
  which LVGL converted from Montserrat and Font Awesome Free glyphs; both
  upstream fonts are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- Python: pyserial (BSD), nvidia-ml-py (BSD), as their package metadata
  states.
